*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "FOLIORLY.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "FolioRelay"
*Product: "(FolioRelay Virtual Printer)"
*ModelName: "FolioRelay Virtual Printer"
*ShortNickName: "FolioRelay Virtual Printer"
*NickName: "FolioRelay Virtual Printer"
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/urf image/urf 0 -"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
